data: {"id": "9074b2ef53464137-thinking-parallel_evidence-928", "run_id": "9074b2ef53464137", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我将执行既有 evidence_plan 中的工具，首先进行 Kubernetes 层面的关键诊断（describe 和 yaml），同时结合已采集的可观测性 baseline。\n\n**计划执行：**\n1. `kubectl_describe` - 获取 Pod 事件和详细状态\n2. `kubectl_get_yaml` - 获取 Pod 完整配置\n3. 已有 Metrics/Logging/Tracing/Topology 首轮结果需结合 describe/yaml 进一步分析\n\n让我先执行 Kubernetes 关键工具：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788782946177, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

