data: {"id": "9074b2ef53464137-thinking-parallel_evidence-1153", "run_id": "9074b2ef53464137", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我已获取到关键的 Kubernetes 描述和 YAML 信息。让我分析已有证据并补充 Topology 查询以完成链路：\n\n从 describe 和 yaml 结果可以看到：\n- Pod 状态：**Pending**（非 Running）\n- 事件：**NoNetworkFound** (multus) + **FailedCreatePodSandBox** (kubelet) × 335次\n- 原因：引用了不存在的网络附件定义 `unavailable-network`\n- Pod 有 annotation `k8s.v1.cni.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`\n- 容器未启动，无日志、无追踪（符合预期，因为 sandbox 未创建）\n\nMetrics 已证实：\n- `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason = 1` (reason: ContainerCreating)\n- `kube_pod_status_phase = 1` (phase: Pending)\n- 重启次数 =", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788782957783, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

