data: {"id": "9074b2ef53464137-thinking-parallel_evidence-1754", "run_id": "9074b2ef53464137", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 已确认事实\n\n**Kubernetes 层面（describe + yaml）：**\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：Pending（非 Running），调度到 node2\n2. **关键事件**：\n   - `Warning NoNetworkFound` (multus): \"cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)\"\n   - `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox` (kubelet): 重复发生 335 次，持续约 77 分钟\n3. **配置侧原因**：Pod 有 annotation `k8s.v1.cni.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`，引用了不存在的网络附件定义\n4. **容器状态**：app 容器 reason=ContainerCreating，restarts=0，未启动\n\n**Metrics 层面（PromQL）", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788782967293, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "9074b2ef53464137-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "9074b2ef53464137", "seq": 1755, "ts_ms": 1788782974559, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 44.385, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/9074b2ef53464137-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "e134540717bb10a14c6faa67b4c24b1a9f8dc8f98cef391769e6b96e9f29d379", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "b4c78c7f897a417fbca2223d3178be38abd77b7c05fcf541bfc00070b2fbbaa0"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "9074b2ef53464137-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "9074b2ef53464137", "seq": 1756, "ts_ms": 1788782974560, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "9074b2ef53464137-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "9074b2ef53464137", "seq": 1757, "ts_ms": 1788782983218, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.658, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1668, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod 配置了不存在的 Multus 网络附件定义 `unavailable-network`（annotation `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks`），导致 Multus 无法解析网络配置，kubelet 持续抛出 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | multus | `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` (fact-060cb7f4d318) | 明确指出了缺失的具体资源名及所属命名空间 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox` ... `failed to setup network` ... `cannot find a network-attachment-definition \"unavailable-network\" not found` (fact-18b81cd55da8) | 确认了网络配置错误直接导致沙箱创建失败的底层机制 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` (fact-cea045a44b9e) | 确认 Pod 处于持续等待状态，未进入运行阶段 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{container=\"app\", reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` (fact-369bbd9e623c) | 从监控指标确认当前存在处于该特定状态的容器实例 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1、2 号事件证据形成了完整的因果闭环：Multus 报出缺失配置错误，kubelet 随即抛出沙箱创建失败错误；3、4 号状态与指标证据确认了该错误导致的最终容器状态表现，排除了运行时的偶发性波动。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 引用不存在的网络定义 (unavailable-network) → Multus 插件查找失败 (NoNetworkFound) → 网络初始化失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 的 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks` 注解中引用了名为 `unavailable-network` 的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition，但该资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。\n\nMultus CNI 插件在尝试初始化网络时无法解析该配置，导致 `kubelet` 在创建 Pod 沙箱时失败 (证据 #2)，进而使 Pod 无法进入运行阶段，一直停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态 (证据 #3, #4)。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod 配置了不存在的 Multus 网络附件定义 `unavailable-network`（annotation `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks`），导致 Multus 无法解析网络配置，kubelet 持续抛出 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | multus | `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` (fact-060cb7f4d318) | 明确指出了缺失的具体资源名及所属命名空间 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox` ... `failed to setup network` ... `cannot find a network-attachment-definition \"unavailable-network\" not found` (fact-18b81cd55da8) | 确认了网络配置错误直接导致沙箱创建失败的底层机制 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` (fact-cea045a44b9e) | 确认 Pod 处于持续等待状态，未进入运行阶段 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{container=\"app\", reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` (fact-369bbd9e623c) | 从监控指标确认当前存在处于该特定状态的容器实例 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1、2 号事件证据形成了完整的因果闭环：Multus 报出缺失配置错误，kubelet 随即抛出沙箱创建失败错误；3、4 号状态与指标证据确认了该错误导致的最终容器状态表现，排除了运行时的偶发性波动。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 引用不存在的网络定义 (unavailable-network) → Multus 插件查找失败 (NoNetworkFound) → 网络初始化失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 的 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks` 注解中引用了名为 `unavailable-network` 的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition，但该资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。\n\nMultus CNI 插件在尝试初始化网络时无法解析该配置，导致 `kubelet` 在创建 Pod 沙箱时失败 (证据 #2)，进而使 Pod 无法进入运行阶段，一直停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态 (证据 #3, #4)。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "9074b2ef53464137-final", "run_id": "9074b2ef53464137", "seq": 1759, "ts_ms": 1788782983230, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod 配置了不存在的 Multus 网络附件定义 `unavailable-network`（annotation `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks`），导致 Multus 无法解析网络配置，kubelet 持续抛出 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | multus | `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` (fact-060cb7f4d318) | 明确指出了缺失的具体资源名及所属命名空间 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox` ... `failed to setup network` ... `cannot find a network-attachment-definition \"unavailable-network\" not found` (fact-18b81cd55da8) | 确认了网络配置错误直接导致沙箱创建失败的底层机制 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` (fact-cea045a44b9e) | 确认 Pod 处于持续等待状态，未进入运行阶段 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{container=\"app\", reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` (fact-369bbd9e623c) | 从监控指标确认当前存在处于该特定状态的容器实例 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1、2 号事件证据形成了完整的因果闭环：Multus 报出缺失配置错误，kubelet 随即抛出沙箱创建失败错误；3、4 号状态与指标证据确认了该错误导致的最终容器状态表现，排除了运行时的偶发性波动。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 引用不存在的网络定义 (unavailable-network) → Multus 插件查找失败 (NoNetworkFound) → 网络初始化失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 的 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks` 注解中引用了名为 `unavailable-network` 的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition，但该资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。\n\nMultus CNI 插件在尝试初始化网络时无法解析该配置，导致 `kubelet` 在创建 Pod 沙箱时失败 (证据 #2)，进而使 Pod 无法进入运行阶段，一直停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态 (证据 #3, #4)。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 25.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 44.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx: 44.4s (Evidence 37.2s, RCA 7.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 78.907, "metrics": {"run_id": "9074b2ef53464137", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 78.91297149658203, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "47%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 78912.97149658203, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 68422.53518104553, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 21040.91715812683, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 10093.723773956299}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 25846.85182571411, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 44385.10465621948, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8657.970428466797, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

